  "title": "Legacy project understanding keeps a multi-domain monolith focused",
  "description": "Runs the real scanner against a small old Express/CommonJS monolith with billing, customers, and reports domains, then verifies ContextPack selects billing evidence without leaking unrelated domain context.",
